<title>USA: Charming Nov same-store sales up 4 pct.</title>
<headline>Charming Nov same-store sales up 4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BENSALEM, Pa. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$79.8	$90.4	 n/a  +     4.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $826.3     $878.3	 n/a  +     5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is four weeks ended   November 30.</p>
<p>    Full company name is Charming Shoppes Inc</p>
<p>NOTE - Since Nov 1995, the company closed 263 stores as part of its previously announced restructuring program.</p>
